      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd also like to see a list of contacts present on an item listed somewhere.\n\nIt's hard to know if an item is worth purchasing because the only way to find out if it has contacts is to wait for someone to find out manually or ask a developer and put it on the VRChat Wiki.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
